    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671900/extras/c2d817ee2000624afd74678319eeec4d.avif?t=1746775894\" width=616 height=150 /></span><strong>Drowned in Hell</strong>  is a challenging and explosive platformer/shooter where mastering your character will be your best bet for survival. Take on hordes of enemies on a variety of paintings, and be stronger than chance and the waters. Unlock new enemies, paintings and characters with unique abilities, until you free your soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671900/extras/8a9c16857b9976d1d85b0640338b88bb.avif?t=1746775894\" width=616 height=130 /></span>You can\u2019t agree with your friends on the best character? Sort it out in a thrilling multiplayer mode for up to 4 players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671900/extras/70be866000b36809cc1c2981dc4f2591.avif?t=1746775894\" width=616 height=150 /></span>Adding this game to your wishlist will take your name out of the book of souls, so don't wait any longer!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671900/extras/c2d817ee2000624afd74678319eeec4d.avif?t=1746775894\" width=616 height=150 /></span><strong>Drowned in Hell</strong>  is a challenging and explosive platformer/shooter where mastering your character will be your best bet for survival. Take on hordes of enemies on a variety of paintings, and be stronger than chance and the waters. Unlock new enemies, paintings and characters with unique abilities, until you free your soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671900/extras/8a9c16857b9976d1d85b0640338b88bb.avif?t=1746775894\" width=616 height=130 /></span>You can\u2019t agree with your friends on the best character? Sort it out in a thrilling multiplayer mode for up to 4 players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671900/extras/70be866000b36809cc1c2981dc4f2591.avif?t=1746775894\" width=616 height=150 /></span>Adding this game to your wishlist will take your name out of the book of souls, so don't wait any longer!</p>",
    "short_description": "When Heaven's tears flood Hell and threaten its precious paintings, the Devil must leave to deal with this mess. In his book of souls, one name stands out to protect them: yours. It's time to pay your debt!",
